{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y把X中更细的音乐推进、声部变化和身体感受压缩了，尤其S04、S11、S14，少了一些层层变化的质感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左侧完整叙述让我更容易先弄清楚发生了什么、为什么会这样，右侧感受词再补充当下的情绪和氛围，前后转折也比较自然。X的重点放大和音乐同步出现的感受很有价值，细腻程度更高，但S05等短停留段落的信息堆叠明显影响阅读，部分感受也有重复。作为边听边扫的普通观众，我更容易跟住Y的故事，同时会觉得X的音乐细节值得保留。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d386598-f92f-4994-8f8a-c305b8818df7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164134936719Z", "elapsed_seconds": 174.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:44:29.870581+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07dbda60ebb9fdb1e41a3e45e88c334ab5af969e52860011291bbf62b09fe69b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa